<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Greenfield.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Greenfield.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey said it downgraded Greenfield Industries Inc to a short-term market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- said it kept Greenfield as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Greenfield dropped 1-1/2 to 22-3/8.</p>
</text>
